# 008 ai data analyst job description — abstract geometric cover v5

Overlapping translucent disks and diamond facets in a loose lattice pattern, blue-purple accent glow on three focal shapes, calm empty area on the left.

Pure abstract background illustration — NOT a website mockup, NOT a slide template, NOT a document page. Soft white (#fafbfc) to pale gray (#f1f5f9) gradient canvas. Abstract geometric forms only: circles, arcs, hexagons, translucent planes, glowing nodes, thin curved connection lines. Contemporary tech aesthetic with cobalt blue (#3b82f6) and violet purple (#8b5cf6) accent glows. Asymmetrical balanced composition: one third of the frame is calm empty gradient (completely blank — no shapes, no marks), geometric focal cluster on the opposite two thirds. Subtle depth via layered translucent shapes, soft ambient glow, gentle depth-of-field separation. Minimal, airy, professional, crisp vector-like edges. Universal multi-topic tech editorial backdrop.

STRICT no-text rule: the image must be 100% non-linguistic visual art. Zero text, zero letters, zero numbers, zero glyphs, zero symbols resembling characters, zero logos, zero watermarks, zero captions, zero UI chrome, zero buttons, zero badges, zero headlines, zero paragraphs, zero readable marks in any language, zero faux handwriting, zero scribbles.

High quality, clean, uncluttered, conveys professionalism and clarity.
